Description: VylarisSpace web server
 VylarisSpace is an open source hosting control panel.
 VylarisSpace has a clean and focused interface without the clutter.
 VylarisSpace has the latest of very innovative technologies.
 VylarisSpace is a modified version of HestiaCP, which is a fork from VestaCP, special thanks to vestacp.com and Serghey Rodin.
